{"id":"n62325-1-10","stage":2,"title":"앓다 · 患","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62325-1-10-1","ko":"얼굴이 안 좋아 보여.","zh":"你看起来气色不太好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"头部前面部分的整体长相或样子。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f15f1263716991e935f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62325-1-10-2","ko":"뭘 잘못 먹었는지 요 며칠 계속 배를 앓아서 그래.","zh":"不知道是不是吃了什么坏东西，这几天一直肚子不舒服。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错","explanation":"잘못：错","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62478","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었는지","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요","meaning":"这（요 며칠：最近这几天）","explanation":"요：这（요 며칠：最近这几天）","readings":[{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67862","senseId":"2","lemma":"요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"며칠","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배를","meaning":"腹部","explanation":"배：腹部；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"2","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앓아서","meaning":"患，得，病","explanation":"앓다：患，得，病；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"앓다","audio":"/audio/387f8dcdd779a212c4b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62325","senseId":"1","lemma":"앓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"“그리하여(那样)”的缩略。","explanation":"그래：“그리하여(那样)”的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60238","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62478","definition":"不正或错误地。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"d525e7107305db85","term":"요","zh":"这（요 며칠：最近这几天）","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3","entryId":"67862","definition":"这（요 며칠：最近这几天）","pronunciation":["요"]},{"id":"879abb6ed1ed4d59","term":"며칠","zh":"几天","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3","entryId":"36676","definition":"几个日子。","pronunciation":["며칠"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"腹部","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中消化食物的肠胃等内脏所在的部位。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"387f8dcdd779a212","term":"앓다","zh":"患，得，病","audio":"/audio/387f8dcdd779a212c4b6.mp3","entryId":"62325","definition":"生病而感到痛苦或难受。","pronunciation":["알타"]},{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"“그리하여(那样)”的缩略。","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"60238","definition":"“그리하여(那样)”的缩略。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/da3e53a5f0c4652c1d5a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62325","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3984,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"option